    324  0a91							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    325  0a91							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    326  0a91							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    327  0a91							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
