    179  15d2							; SMART CHORD / EXTENSIONS: each held note becomes a chord built in the key.
    180  15d2							; A note in the scale gets its diatonic chord (stacked scale thirds: triad,
    181  15d2							; or 7 / 9 / 11 / 13 with extensions). A note outside the scale gets a
    182  15d2							; major triad (+ b7, 9, 11, 13). Results merge, ascending, at most 8.
